WEBVTT

00:11:30.004 --> 00:11:32.888
that was said to last
for two hours and 12 minutes?

00:11:33.689 --> 00:11:38.434
Well, one of the players from that game
ended up, six years later,

00:11:38.458 --> 00:11:42.576
in the concentration camps
of Auschwitz and Dachau.

00:11:43.944 --> 00:11:45.824
But he walked out alive.

00:11:47.145 --> 00:11:48.555
Why?

00:11:48.579 --> 00:11:51.709
Simply because a guard in the gas chamber

00:11:51.733 --> 00:11:54.896
recognized him from
his ping-pong playing days.

00:11:56.326 --> 00:11:59.397
Had he been the winner of that epic match?

00:11:59.421 --> 00:12:00.739
It hardly mattered.